{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212410","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121241001:0":{"text":"アルファⅪ！どうして逃げたの？","source_cn":"阿尔法十一！你为什么逃走？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EE90592E5B7D3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121241002:0":{"text":"色んな人が、質問してくるから、嫌だったの……","source_cn":"那里提问的人太多了，我很不自在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38AA0ABC034F5A7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121241003:0":{"text":"まったく……詳しく病状を聞かないことには、あなたの病気を治せないでしょ？別に問い詰めてるわけじゃないのよ。","source_cn":"真是的……要给你治病，总得问清楚病状吧？大家是在关心你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8422DE7FF23D49E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121241004:0":{"text":"この谷は危険なの、急いで戻るわよ。","source_cn":"这片山谷很危险，赶紧跟我们回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E38797431B5A6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121241005:0":{"text":"待って。この青い花は何？夢の中で見たことがあるの。","source_cn":"等等，我想知道这片蓝色的花朵是什么？它们在我的梦中出现过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3A96C93DCBB270","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121241006:0":{"text":"花？ああ、魔花のことね。","source_cn":"花？哦，你说这些魔花啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F401AAB6238A2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121241007:0":{"text":"落ち葉の季節があと二回ほど過ぎれば、この花は蛍光花という生き物になるのよ。","source_cn":"大约再过两个落叶季，它们会长成名为荧荧花的生物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C29F2F9C64FE71E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1121241007":{"text":"落ち葉の季節があと二回ほど過ぎれば、この花は蛍光花という生き物になるのよ。","source_cn":"大约再过两个落叶季，它们会长成名为荧荧花的生物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C29F2F9C64FE71E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121241008:0":{"text":"あら、初耳だった？どうやらユグドラシルには、まだまだあなたの知らない事がたくさんあるようね。メイジさん。","source_cn":"是哦，你第一次听说吗？看来薄暮丛林仍有很多事值得你去探...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5A375207553366E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あら、初耳だった？どうやらユグドラシルには、まだまだあなたの知らない事がたくさんあるようね。メイジさん。","female":"あら、初耳だった？どうやらユグドラシルには、まだまだあなたの知らない事がたくさんあるようね。メイジさん。","variant_male_record_index":"118853","variant_female_record_index":"118854","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121241009:0":{"text":"蛍光花が死ぬと、体は大地に還り、再び魔花が誕生するの。これが命の循環というものよ。","source_cn":"荧荧花死亡后，身体也将回归大地，再次生出魔花。这便是生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA731B71210076EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121241010:0":{"text":"よく、分からない。\n大地に還るって何？命の循環って？","source_cn":"我好像没听懂。\\n回归大地是什么？生命的循环又是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D28D8473874C245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121241011:0":{"text":"それはあとで。今は体を治すのが先よ。弱ってたら頭だってまわらないでしょ？さあ、帰りましょう。","source_cn":"那就不要理解了，你现在身体不好嘛，脑子也会跟不上的，先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x004996E287629C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121241012:0":{"text":"でも、知りたいの。","source_cn":"可是，我想知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E1AB4D9EC3645F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121241013:0":{"text":"わがままねぇ……\nそのうちゆっくり話してあげるわよ。","source_cn":"真是任性……\\n没办法，有机会的话，我再慢慢讲给你听吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0717354CB2852523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121241014:0":{"text":"心配しないで、私、一度言ったことは曲げないたちなの。約束は絶対に守るわ。","source_cn":"放心，我可是个很守信用的人。既然答应你了，我一定会做到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB7DF4EC774E28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema